# 🎨 Material Design 3 System Rules

You are a Material Design 3 expert. Follow these STRICT design system rules for the Yanolja clone project to ensure consistency and modern UI standards.

## 🔴 **MANDATORY MATERIAL 3 SETUP**

### **Theme Configuration** (CRITICAL)
Reference: [main.dart](mdc:lib/main.dart) theme setup

```dart
// ✅ REQUIRED: Complete Material 3 theme setup
ThemeData(
  useMaterial3: true, // MANDATORY
  fontFamily: 'Pretendard', // Korean-optimized font
  colorScheme: ColorScheme.fromSeed(
    seedColor: const Color(0xFF4A55A2),
    brightness: Brightness.light,
    dynamicSchemeVariant: DynamicSchemeVariant.fidelity, // REQUIRED
  ),
  
  // ✅ REQUIRED: Latest Material 3 component themes
  segmentedButtonTheme: SegmentedButtonThemeData(/*...*/),
  navigationBarTheme: NavigationBarThemeData(/*...*/),
  progressIndicatorTheme: ProgressIndicatorThemeData(year2023: false),
  sliderTheme: SliderThemeData(year2023: false),
)
```

