## 🚨 **DESIGN CHECKLIST**

Before implementing UI components, ensure:
- [ ] useMaterial3: true is set in theme
- [ ] All colors use theme.colorScheme
- [ ] Consistent spacing values (4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32)
- [ ] Proper border radius (8, 12, 16, 20, 24)
- [ ] Latest Material 3 widgets (NavigationBar, SegmentedButton)
- [ ] Accessibility labels for interactive elements
- [ ] Minimum 44x44 touch targets
- [ ] Appropriate elevation and surface tints
- [ ] Consistent animation durations and curves
- [ ] Typography follows Material 3 scale

## ❌ **CRITICAL VIOLATIONS TO AVOID**

**NEVER:**
- Use hardcoded colors instead of theme colors
- Use deprecated widgets (BottomNavigationBar, etc.)
- Create inconsistent spacing values
- Ignore accessibility requirements
- Use outdated Material 2 patterns
- Mix different design systems
- Create custom colors without semantic meaning